 "id": "1013963573823261", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974526_1013963577156594_2061989920474998390_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SkQd2tZ3zhwQ7kNvwEOB-Ys&_nc_oc=Adk7Hs7qNYOTAXZAfDQBbOxo3ldO5unJINGWgzApuDMC2kHkR6YgMF4euykDR7coCmc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftkfh8TE-c5BlPe9AKT1Q9bZUem4roQYWlezMdc88fZsQ&oe=69A57416"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-05.png", "id": "2121495998306034", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982488_2121496001639367_6867377017957057624_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fd2MEfwK04cQ7kNvwFpDojD&_nc_oc=AdlaMGgriePjjF-kSWNl4QtTxcldiFmtOyTtMvwQYY_VKjPAct1i-QTPlx4dIK_1dVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvBG6W26TTpH8Hqg_RlhSMHrfgYmFhyaRscBsv4_XmYpw&oe=69A58E2A"}, {"file_name": "Squingle-Twinkled-Screenshot-01.png", "id": "1186035523063640", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974783_1186035526396973_4771898997726366931_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KAPfvYFh8aoQ7kNvwEveuNR&_nc_oc=AdkCZWiMPJOyCm2VZC0SMtMSa0aTNl_GzALnNyFR_hz4rafaSdC44Fna3FZYTOIRhbM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftNlOrSaQ3yeEy1tmz9IeY1ghkrXXVMLk9V6Xgs1wluPQ&oe=69A56C0F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "487841280996149", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031435_487841284329482_7014507726029390394_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lFMFXVCbFiIQ7kNvwGAZQix&_nc_oc=AdmEUkM6g5B85drtPE17sJHDR66n1zcT77-8O4PS--uDRjcrZD7iBrP_xI8tTPZRJoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft5xOqja97-Vk55n96mNYdPa2thG0o-PJ5BtBwdP9iJAg&oe=69A56F71"}, "display_name": "Squingle", "keywords": ["puzzle", "mr", "puzzling", "squingle"], "long_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit.\n\n#  \u2728 100 LEVELS\nLaunching with 100 levels, with more added over time. Levels grow complex, featuring tighter spaces and new challenges.\n\n# \ud83c\udf08 A VISUAL MASTERPIECE\nEach maze is a stunning, morphing sculpture, offering an unmatched visual experience in Mixed Reality or fully immersive modes.\n\n# \ud83e\udde9 EASY TO PICK, HARD TO MASTER\nDesigned to be accessible for both newcomers to VR and experts seeking a transcendent experience, with intuitive controls and hand tracking support for seamless play, whether standing or seated.\n\n# \ud83d\ude0c RELAX & UNWIND\nPlay on the sofa or in room-sized mazes. Squingle\u2019s calming gameplay will soothe your soul.\n\n# \ud83c\udfc5 AWARDS\n- Best VR Game ~ GDWC Finalist\n- Finalist ~ QLDXR Festival\n- \u201cBest of the Quest\u201d ~ Gibby\u2019s Guide\n\n# FEATURES\n- Challenge Mode: Time trials and global leaderboards.\n- Room/Mini scale: Play big or small!\n- Race your ghost: Beat your best times.\n\n\nGet ready to be Squingled!", "short_description": "Squingle is a cosmic 3D puzzle game that could only exist in VR.\n\nYour challenge is to guide 2 spinning orbs to the goal through intricate, glass-like mazes called \u2018squingles.\u2019 \n\nEach level offers a mesmerizing visual experience, featuring dynamic, morphing sculptures that come to life in fully immersive environments or in Mixed Reality. \n\nWith intuitive controls and hand-tracking support, Squingle will captivate your mind and spirit."}]}, "developer_name": "Dr. Benjamin Outram ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://squingle.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRA